<title>SPAIN: Koipe sales drop as olive sales down.</title>
<headline>Koipe sales drop as olive sales down.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for six months to end June in billions of pesetas for Spain's Koipe, unless stated:</p>
<p> Group net profit			 1.258  vs 2.571</p>
<p> Group turnover			 47.485   vs   55.955</p>
<p> Parent net				  585   vs   915</p>
<p> Parent turnover			28.445   vs 26.901</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of company is Koipe Group. Koipe said sales drop reflects fall in consumption of olive oil as prices rose because of higher olive prices caused by deficient harvest.</p>
<p>Sunflower and seeds oil consumption rose, but not enough to compensate for drop in olive oil, Koipe said.</p>
</text>
